=1 4433 10
+    The serial ports are the communications and printer lines
+    of the DZ multiplexer, which the firmware reports as the
+    serial controllers of the internal bus.  It queries the
+    firmware data for them and places them in the passed in
+    list.  There are no "user" specified comm ports: the
+    multiplexer has no other lines with modem control.
